                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>1.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The data in the dashboard currently has the data on </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Discounts</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> only that contributes to </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>over 80%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> of GMV / GFV, </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Vouchers</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> that hold </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>under 20%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> will be added later</run>
