                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>2.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> The </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>data is subject to change</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> once the data source will be expanded and improved</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>3. The currently known discrepancy between the data stream and local team reporting </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>in APAC is 10%</run>
